  "description": "2026 DJ Mag cover star Lilly Palmer returns to the poll again this year. Since releasing her debut album, ‘Bigger Than Techno’, on Armada Music in March, the Amsterdam-based artist has signed a worldwide deal with Universal Music/Island Records. With a second LP in the works, including plenty of “unexpected” collaborations, Lilly says she’s “always thinking outside the box and exploring new creative ways to express myself through my music and performances”. Next, Lilly aims to take her sound and style to a “whole new dimension”, level up her label Spannung Records, embark on a “crazy two-month Asia tour”, and host “a big boat party at ADE this year”.",
